        "sha": "93f0d669d42bbf50a0dae42ff65b3e12a775eaa5",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/93f0d669d42bbf50a0dae42ff65b3e12a775eaa5"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 93f0d669d42bbf50a0dae42ff65b3e12a775eaa5\nparent ae7d92d02e845f4c22dbf2d0f4554b6ab59db623\nauthor Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1793110516 -0400\ncommitter Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1793654054 +0900\n\nrefactor: move prune bookkeeping into BlockManager\n\nMove FlushStateToDisk's handling of the prune request, prune locks,\npruned flag, files to delete and blocks directory space check into\nBlockManager. The prune request is cleared before the prune locks are\napplied rather than after selection, which differs only if selection\nthrows.\n\nAn Assume checks that the pruned flag is set before files are queued\nfor deletion, so a restart knows blocks were deleted.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRDOJ0y42q5v3cnTlwCOQEUuCajwQUCauj9JhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQAjkBFLgmo8FORAD/XNnu5APMPcwVkEcoxxiN\nG8wd3FVxF37nmmwXaMOBp+QA/jIzT20fFaf10fXb09G99TNzmAWQyTY2Nd0EEud9\ninwJ\n=h71r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
